  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Resident Evil Remake Trilogy",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/18370/450x258/resident-evil-remake-trilogy-trilogy-pc-game-steam-europe-cover.jpg?v=1795809600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/18370-buy-resident-evil-remake-trilogy-trilogy-pc-game-steam-europe/",
      "user": "xNSXKlon",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/6626621-1795806000.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "The Resident Evil Remake Trilogy is an outstanding collection that perfectly demonstrates how to modernize classic games without losing what made them special. Each entry brings something unique to the table, from the intense survival horror atmosphere of Resident Evil 2, through the action-packed experience of Resident Evil 3, to the brilliant combination of horror and action in Resident Evil 4.\n\n\n\nThe graphics, sound design, atmosphere, and attention to detail are exceptional. The gameplay feels smooth and satisfying, while the environments are beautifully designed and full of memorable moments. Each game offers its own experience, and together they create an unforgettable journey through one of gaming's most iconic franchises.\n\n\n\nWhether you're a longtime fan or a newcomer to Resident Evil, this trilogy is absolutely worth playing. A fantastic mix of horror, action, exploration, and storytelling. Highly recommended!"
    },
    {
      "game": "Life is Strange: Double Exposure",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/6829/450x258/life-is-strange-double-exposure-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1795809600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/6829-buy-life-is-strange-double-exposure-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-bcee029",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Good game nice to do and see many option to the question \"what if?\" ...the narration follow your idea of the story the ending is nice in its way. It is a nice Life is Strange and Max power are back"
    },
    {
      "game": "Monster Hunter Stories 3: Twisted Reflection",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/20011/450x258/monster-hunter-stories-3-twisted-reflection-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1795809600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/20011-buy-monster-hunter-stories-3-twisted-reflection-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-0b6dc96",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "I'd say it's by far the best entry i the stories series. Music, enviornments, visuals. Overall just a relly good package.\n\n\n\nJust don't get it for the full price !\n\n\n\nDon't get me wrong. I really love the game and Monster hunter as a whole, but the game is nowhere near an actual 70 euro/dollar (whatever it is full price for you) worth. \n\n\n\nTheres no actual endgame, no coop missions like in the second game, and the fights can feel a little more repetetive than the previous entrys. To top it all of, Capcom decided that this would be the title to put paid DLC in. The most expensive Storties game so far, with the least amount of content. \n\n\n\nIt's a really good expirience BUT, it could and should have been much more for the price tag"
    },
